# Menu

Read **`src/_page-components/MENU.md`** before editing nav content.

## Wiring

- Desktop/mobile driven from `desktop-menu.html`, `mobile-menu.html`, `header-content.html`
- Header `data-dropdown-id` and mobile `data-child-links-list-id` must match each row's `data-menu-id` / `data-parent-link-id`

## Shop menu

Active variant is **`-extended`**; legacy variant kept for reference only — check MENU.md before changes.

## Shop extended labels

`menu-shop-extended-links.html`: `.shop-extended__menu-text` uses `data-text` so CSS reserves bold-hover width via `attr(data-text)`.

**`data-text` must exactly match the text inside that span** — mismatch shifts badges/layout on hover.
